        <activityName xml:lang="en">1-butanol, propylene hydroformylation, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 1-butanol, propylene hydroformylation, at plant
The multioutput-process  "propylene hydroformylation" delivers the co-products 2-methyl-1-butanol and 1-butanol. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: b323f136-28be-3e86-bea4-e77610261147
Hydroformylation of propylene including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Direct hydration of ethylene
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b323f136-28be-3e86-bea4-e77610261147.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
